  "body": "## What changed\n\nThe quick gate selects suites that read a changed fixture directory.\nIt scans suite sources and declared helper modules across crates.\nIt resolves paths without requiring the fixture to exist.\nIt uses the static directory prefix of formatted paths.\nImporter changes also select `app:feature_edge_g1_join`, `kernel:step_agreement`, and `kernel:machining_mesh`.\nThe existing selection remains in the plan.\n\n## Cause\n\nThe quick plan used crate paths and gate maps.\nIt ignored root testdata changes.\nThe app importer map did not select the independent kernel checks.\nPR #2664 exposed both gaps.\n\n## Tests\n\n- `gate_maps_tests::importer_changes_select_step_and_feature_edge_suites`\n- `gate_maps_tests::changed_testdata_selects_its_directory_readers`\n- `gate_maps_tests::fixture_paths_select_cross_crate_directory_helpers`\n\nThe pins failed before the fix.\nThe real cases use the importer and fixture paths from #2664.\nSmall fixtures cover seven importer paths, added and deleted files, shared helpers, cross-crate paths, and formatted goldens.\nThey also exclude unrelated directories and matching name prefixes.\nRestoring the original quick planner made each pin fail.\nRestoring the fix made each pin pass.\nRemoving the formatted-path handling also made its case fail.\nRestoring that handling made it pass.\n\nThe full quick gate passed with all 174 unit tests and seven integration binaries.\nThe first gate failed because sccache could not write its preprocessor cache.\nThe full retry passed with the cache disabled:\n`cargo --config 'env.CAMCRAFT_NO_SCCACHE=\"1\"' xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`.\n`cargo clippy -p xtask --all-targets -- -D warnings` passed.\nThe hunk review and `git diff --check upstream/main` passed.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone. The `.nc` and `.cl` diff is empty.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nThe batch and release gates did not run.\nThe selected geometry suites did not run against the historical #2664 head.\nA computed path with no literal fixture directory can need an explicit rule.\n\n## Overlaps\n\nNone. No open PR changes the touched files.\n\nEffort: medium\n\nProcess change: yes\n\nChangelog: The quick gate selects fixture directory readers and independent STEP checks after importer changes.\n\nFixes #2740\n",
